cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the reviewed records, please cite this release.
type: software
title: "Revealing the Hidden Landscape of Public Metabolomics Data Reuse in MetaboLights"
authors:
  - family-names: "Karaman"
    given-names: "Ibrahim"
  - family-names: "Payne"
    given-names: "Thomas"
  - family-names: "Vizcaíno"
