license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Code, manually reviewed publication-dataset records, analysis results and
  figures supporting the study of public MetaboLights data reuse. The workflow
  collects candidate publications, supports manual screening, and calculates
  publication and dataset reuse summaries.
keywords:
  - MetaboLights
  - metabolomics
  - data reuse

